  "instructions": [
    "heat chicken fat in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "cook garlic and ginger until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "add rehydrated kombu seaweed and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "add carnaroli rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "add water and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "add lemon juice, rice vinegar, and soy sauce, and stir to combine.",
    "season with salt to taste, if needed",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
